                <mxCell id="chunkNote" value="⟲ &lt;b&gt;Chunked wait&lt;/b&gt; (replaces the parallel reminder branch): each waitForTaskToken segment ≤ 24h — TimeoutSecondsPath = min(24h, time to rung deadline). States.Timeout → keep-warm reminder → re-arm. Resolution exits the loop, so an orphaned reminder timer cannot exist." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#E0C068;fontColor=#7a5a10;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
